Thought: The current leader is a robust median on the full pool. A more stable subset (pool2) might yield a cleaner median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2","rationale":"robust median on the most stable subset"}

Thought: Try weighted inverse error on the full pool with moderate shrinkage to reduce variance, hoping to beat the robust median.  
Action: weights_inverse_error  
