Thought: create meta‑model weights on the stable pool2 to see if a dataset‑level meta‑model improves over the robust median.  
Action: weights_meta_model  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool2","scope":"dataset","metric":"smape","eta":1.0}  

Thought: evaluate the meta‑model weights on pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"w3","rationale":"meta‑model weights on stable pool"}  

