Action: weights_inverse_error  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool4","metric":"rmse","shrinkage":0.5,"per_horizon":true}

Thought: Try cross‑series meta‑model weights and Caruana forward weights on the full pool to see if they beat the robust median.  
Action: weights_meta_model  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool_full","scope":"dataset","metric":"smape","eta":1.0}  
Thought: Evaluate the meta‑model weighted combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w7","rationale":"cross‑series meta‑model weights"}  
Thought: Try Caruana forward selection weights on the full pool.  
Action: weights_forward  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool_full","max_steps":20,"metric":"rmse"}  
Thought: Evaluate the forward‑selected weighted combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w8","rationale":"Caruana forward selection weights"}

Thought: The median of the full pool remains the best robust choice; no new strategy is expected to beat it given the unstable ranking and strong trend dominance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full","rationale":"final choice"}

